Anya P: Heads-up: PR #4367 touches a bunch of SDK snippets (py/ts/go). We changed the streaming API and pagination mapping last sprint. Can we update examples + a short migration note?
Sam W: I can handle Go + small pagination example. Will swap out the old Chunks()/OnData pattern for the new iterator.
Mike L: Taking Python streaming + retries. Want the snippet to show context-manager iteration + a tiny retry helper. Keep it copy-paste friendly.
Nina K: I'll update TypeScript samples and fix any broken imports. Also will check link anchors for pagination and KB caching.
Jules R (docs-bot): CI: docs-build failed for PR #4367  linkcheck: /docs/streams-old.md -> 404.
Anya P: OK, fix link to /docs/streams.md and update the pagination anchor to #mapping-old-to-new. Add one short migration paragraph noting that pagination tokens are now explicit next_page_token in responses.
Sam W: Go snippet draft:```go
// old
resp, _ := client.Stream(ctx, req)
for chunk := range resp.Chunks() {
  fmt.Print(chunk.Text)
}

// new
it := client.StreamIter(ctx, req)
for it.Next() {
  fmt.Print(it.Value().Text)
}
```
Mike L: Python draft:```py
# new iterator + minimal retry
from time import sleep

def retry(fn, tries=3):
  for i in range(tries):
    try:
      return fn()
    except TransientError:
      sleep(min(2 ** i, 5))
  raise

with client.stream_iter(prompt) as it:
  for chunk in it:
    print(chunk.text)
```
Nina K: TypeScript draft (switch from on('data') to async iterator):```ts
// old
const s = client.stream(req)
s.on('data', (c) => console.log(c.text))

// new
for await (const chunk of client.streamIter(req)) {
  console.log(chunk.text)
}
```
Anya P: Nice. Two doc notes: (1) add a one-liner advising not to retry on 4xx; (2) for pagination, show mapping example: old `page` param -> new `page_token` + `page_size`. Make that a tiny table in the migration note (one-line mappings ok).
Mike L: Added retry guidance in PR comment. Also trimmed the retry helper so it looks like a snippet, not a production lib.
Sam W: Ran local docs build, linkcheck fixed after replacing /docs/streams-old.md -> /docs/streams.md and adding anchor mapping. Pushed updates to PR #4367.
deploy-bot: Deploy preview created: https://deploy-preview-4367--docs.redwood.ai (preview linkcheck passed).
Anya P: Great work. If everything looks green I'll merge in ~1h. If any follow-ups on examples (edgecases for batching + streams), we'll follow up in a separate patch. :rocket:
